08lwroly1kznlf9q","https://research.google/blog/agenthands-generating-interactive-hand-gestures-for-spatially-grounded-agent-conversations-in-xr"],"articles":[{"id":"cmt93murb08lwroly1kznlf9q","title":"AgentHands：为XR空间对话智能体生成交互式手部手势","originalTitle":"","summary":"Google在CHI 2026发布研究原型AgentHands，利用LLM为XR对话智能体生成与语音同步的富有表现力的手部手势，提供空间锚定的物理指引。该系统通过眼动追踪和场景重建注册物体，由LLM生成内联GestureEvents，并在头显上按词级时间戳协调TTS与动画引擎，实现手势与语音的精准同步。应用场景包括兰花养护交互式教学、3D打印机操作技术讲解和生活方式陪伴。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmt93murb08lwroly1kznlf9q","originalUrl":"https://research.google/blog/agenthands-generating-interactive-hand-gestures-for-spatially-grounded-agent-conversations-in-xr","publishedAt":"2026-08-26T00:02:12.858Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-u8es94","originalSourceName":"Google Research：Blog（网页）","family":"google","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmt93murb08lwroly1kznlf9q","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T22:48:47.905Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-u8es94","name":"Google Research：Blog（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T22:48:47.905Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Google在CHI 2026发布研究原型AgentHands，利用LLM为XR对话智能体生成与语音同步的富有表现力的手部手势，提供空间锚定的物理指引。该系统通过眼动追踪和场景重建注册物体，由LLM生成内联GestureEvents，并在头显上按词级时间戳协调TTS与动画引擎，实现手势与语音的精准同步。应用场景包括兰花养护交互式教学、3D打印机操作技术讲解和生活方式陪伴。","reportEdition":"2026-08-26","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmt8qe8m43krcro733w0g56m6","title":"STARFlow2